    "chunk_text": "\u00e6r \u00f0an abraham gewurde.Ic eom; Abraham wear\u00f0 gesceapen.swa swa gesceaft.Crist hine gesceop swa swa scyppend.se \u00f0e Ne cw\u00e6\u00f0 se h\u00e6lend.\u00e6r \u00f0an \u00f0e abraham w\u00e6re ic w\u00e6s.ac he cw\u00e6\u00f0.\u00e6r \u00f0an \u00fee abraham gewurde. \u00de\u00e6t word belimp\u00f0 synderlice to gode anum.Ic eom.for \u00f0an \u00f0e he is ana buton anginne.and ende. Ic eom.se \u00f0e eom.and sege Israhela bearnum.se \u00f0e is.sende me to eow; Gesceafta sind \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fe\u00e6t hi sind.ac \u00f0is word ne m\u00e6g so\u00f0lice beon be him gecweden.\u00f0onne hi He m\u00e6g so\u00f0lice cwe\u00f0an.Ic eom.\u00fe\u00e6t is on leden.Ego sum; Hi \u00f0a namon stanas.\u00fe\u00e6t hi hine Hi h\u00e6fdon st\u00e6nene heardnysse on heora heortan.and for \u00f0i to \u00f0am stanum urnon \u00f0am \u00f0e hi gelice Se h\u00e6lend so\u00f0lice hine behydde.and eode of \u00f0am temple; He forbeah heora stanas.swa swa mann.swa swa eadmod.se \u00f0e mihte \u00feurh his godcundnysse Eac is sum \u00f0ing digele on \u00fe\u00e6re d\u00e6de; He behydde hine lichamlice wi\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6ra iudeiscra st\u00e6ninge.and he behydde hine gastlice fram Lucas se godspellere awrat on o\u00f0re stowe.\u00fe\u00e6t \u00f0a Iudei l\u00e6ddon crist \u00e6t sumum s\u00e6le to anum He nolde \u00f0one dea\u00f0 \u00ferowian \u00f0e hi gecuron.",
